# Every `kw_sv_dollar_*` token below carries its IEEE `$`-spelling literal (SV-0029,
# tree SV-DOLLAR-LRM-FIDELITY: wave 1 = the 12 specify timing checks, wave 3 = $root/
# $unit/severity/bare `$`): the `sv_dollar_*` RULE NAMES are the canonicalized forms of
# those `$` spellings and are KEPT even though the `_<hash>` suffix was derived
# (sha1[:8]) from the old mangled literal — renaming would churn the pinned cert
# residual/NO-reach name lists.
kw_sv_dollar_fullskew_1e1514b3 := trivia /\$fullskew\b/

